# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Release policy: source code and provenance. No input data, no derived data,
# no results. Every pattern below is deliberate. Do not relax without review.
#
# Provenance is the one narrow exception, admitted at the foot of this file: a
# study may publish the column map it read its records through, the digests of
# the record set it fixed, and the parameters behind each run. None of those
# carries an observation, and without them a claim that the code produced the
# reported numbers cannot be checked by anyone outside the project.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Input data of any kind
data/
raw/
input/
inputs/
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv
*.tsv
*.parquet
*.sav
*.dta
*.json
!examples/*.example.json

# Local schema descriptions derived from source files
config/
*.schema.json

# Derived and output artefacts
outputs/
output/
results/
figures/
figs/
tables/
artefacts/
artifacts/
logs/
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.svg
*.pdf
*.eps
*.tif
*.tiff

# Documents
*.docx
*.doc
*.odt
*.pptx
*.md.bak

# Model and cache artefacts
models/
checkpoints/
*.pkl
*.joblib
*.h5
*.pt
*.onnx

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
env/
.env
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Editor and operating system
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Scratch files used to pass a commit message to git without a shell heredoc
_commit_message.txt

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Published provenance, re-admitted after the blanket rules above.
#
# A column map, digests of the fixed record set, and the parameters behind each
# run. These describe the analysis; they do not contain any part of it. Results
# and records remain excluded, so a study directory may hold these three things
# and nothing else that the rules above would have caught.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!studies/*/study.schema.json
!studies/*/record_snapshot.json
!studies/*/manifests/*.json

# Archive metadata for the deposit that mints the citable identifier.
!.zenodo.json
